From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:01:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Send registrations to the Footy Up platform when
 PLATFORM_API_URL is set

Every form (camp and Miami checkout, the Miami access-code gate, private
training checkout and inquiries) forwards its request unchanged to the
platform's /api/site/* endpoints, so it lands in Supabase and the admin
dashboard. Pages pick up live prices from /api/catalog. With
PLATFORM_API_URL unset, the original code runs exactly as before.
